    // Transmitir a Lichess
    lichessBoton: ["Transmitir a Lichess", "Broadcast to Lichess"],
    lichessTitulo: ["Transmitir a Lichess", "Broadcast to Lichess"],
    lichessTexto: ["Las partidas de las mesas (las que llegan de las cámaras y las escritas acá) y sus resultados se mandan a una transmisión tuya de Lichess. 1) Crea una clave en lichess.org/account/oauth/token/create con el permiso de estudios y transmisiones («study:write»). 2) Crea la transmisión en lichess.org/broadcast/new y, adentro, una ronda para la ronda {r}. 3) Pega acá la clave y el enlace de esa ronda. La clave queda solo en esta computadora.", "The games on the tables (those from the cameras and those written here) and their results are sent to a Lichess broadcast of yours. 1) Create a token at lichess.org/account/oauth/token/create with the studies and broadcasts permission (\"study:write\"). 2) Create the broadcast at lichess.org/broadcast/new and, inside it, a round for round {r}. 3) Paste the token and the link to that round here. The token stays on this computer only."],
